    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d51">

                <pb facs="0156" n="60" sameAs="frus:frus1898/pg60"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Sherman to the Governor of Pennsylvania.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1897-12-22"><hi rendition="#italic">December 22,
                        1897</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Referring to your letter of 11th instant, I desire to say that the Austrian
                    minister is pressing for a copy of the promised Hazleton investigation report
                    concerning the killing and wounding of Austrian subjects in September last.
                    Please expedite, if possible.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">John Sherman</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
